{"4199050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slop Simulator", "steam_appid": 4199050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome and congratulations on joining our <strong>big family</strong>, you and your friends are going to love the fast food industry! Your brand new restaurant location will soon attract clients and we want it to be a success just as much as you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To ensure we're on the same page regarding customer satisfaction and employee well-being, here's a list of our values:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Locally sourced, fresh ingredients</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/c8f481fbeb6f32f0a96824d816a844cd.poster.avif?t=1786634228\" aria-label=\"The player looks for trash in first person and collects items they put in a wooden crate. They&#039;re shown in third person running around with other junk in their hands.\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/c8f481fbeb6f32f0a96824d816a844cd.webm?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/c8f481fbeb6f32f0a96824d816a844cd.mp4?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk around the backstreets and collect pizza boxes, toilet cleaner, trash bags, and pretty much anything: your coworkers in the kitchen will find a use for it in the <strong>Slop Machine</strong>! This marvel of technology can turn everything into delicious slop, even inedible trash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ingredient can be turned into a specific kind of slop: battery acid's pretty sour so it'll be <strong>Fuego</strong> flavor, dead rats are <strong>Meaty</strong>, and buckets of paint are thick, delicious <strong>Creamy</strong>. Find the right garbage and mix and match!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A wide range of menu options</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/2075bb6d014b5cdcf6f92862f525cd02.poster.avif?t=1786634228\" aria-label=\"A carboard bucket is filled with green goop, which is then microwaved and drawn on with chocolate syrup. The drawing is of a &quot;cool S&quot;.\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/2075bb6d014b5cdcf6f92862f525cd02.webm?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/2075bb6d014b5cdcf6f92862f525cd02.mp4?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't just prepare a batch of slop in advance and call it a day: each customer will want a specific <strong>flavor</strong> and may request an additional something, <strong>toppings</strong>, or one of many other options your menu can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With time you'll even unlock <strong>drinks</strong> you can make out of fruits you'll grow yourself! Delicious lemonade with a perfectly legal amount of toxic fertilizer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management knows how important it is to make the restaurant feel like it's really yours so you can change the name of each of the flavors! You think &quot;<strong>Ooey gooey yellowey tastey</strong>&quot; is better than &quot;<strong>Creamy</strong>&quot;? You got it, chef!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the neighborhood</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/62d0ba223a26aeb5e1d0432acbd161af.poster.avif?t=1786634228\" aria-label=\"A player stacks objects and human bodies to make platforms and climb on them\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/62d0ba223a26aeb5e1d0432acbd161af.webm?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/62d0ba223a26aeb5e1d0432acbd161af.mp4?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to success is knowing your environment: you're encouraged to explore your surroundings, break into homes, and get to know the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a place that's too hard to reach? You can <strong>stack items</strong> as high as you'd like to build ladders, towers and bridges, so you can climb them while yelling &quot;PARKOUR!!&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There's something for everyone!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/175917c3f49c186946b77befdd4f2b82.poster.avif?t=1786634228\" aria-label=\"The player jumps on trampolines, watches television with friends, and plays a game where you&#039;re a bear throwing a seal for points.\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/175917c3f49c186946b77befdd4f2b82.webm?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/175917c3f49c186946b77befdd4f2b82.mp4?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Oh bother</i>, did your friends drag you into this? Don't worry! There's plenty to do even if you don't care about the restaurant's financial success! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could build jump puzzles with <strong>trampolines</strong>, play <strong>video games</strong> on the company laptop, and there's a rumor out there that the <strong>sewers</strong> hold countless riches and wonders for those brave enough to face them...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why you should you play this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/4466dc8f748f258d893f319c88623ade.poster.avif?t=1786634228\" aria-label=\"The player chases a raccoon, dances with a coworker while holding trash bags, and puts a human body in the slop machine then turns it on.\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/4466dc8f748f258d893f319c88623ade.webm?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/4466dc8f748f258d893f319c88623ade.mp4?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slop Simulator is a goofy, <strong>chaotic</strong>, and kinda gross fast food simulator. It's a perfect game for you and your friends to mess around for the evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no player cap, it's full of shitty Unity Asset Store models and out-of-bounds <strong>secrets</strong>, you can play however you'd like with very few restrictions and there's so many main and side activities that everybody can find something they'll enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was made by a human with no generative AI involved, because that stuff really stinks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slop Simulator is a short joke project that turned into a one-year-long actual game, you're going to have a fantastic time. - MonAmiral</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome and congratulations on joining our <strong>big family</strong>, you and your friends are going to love the fast food industry! Your brand new restaurant location will soon attract clients and we want it to be a success just as much as you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To ensure we're on the same page regarding customer satisfaction and employee well-being, here's a list of our values:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Locally sourced, fresh ingredients</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/c8f481fbeb6f32f0a96824d816a844cd.poster.avif?t=1786634228\" aria-label=\"The player looks for trash in first person and collects items they put in a wooden crate. They&#039;re shown in third person running around with other junk in their hands.\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/c8f481fbeb6f32f0a96824d816a844cd.webm?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/c8f481fbeb6f32f0a96824d816a844cd.mp4?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk around the backstreets and collect pizza boxes, toilet cleaner, trash bags, and pretty much anything: your coworkers in the kitchen will find a use for it in the <strong>Slop Machine</strong>! This marvel of technology can turn everything into delicious slop, even inedible trash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ingredient can be turned into a specific kind of slop: battery acid's pretty sour so it'll be <strong>Fuego</strong> flavor, dead rats are <strong>Meaty</strong>, and buckets of paint are thick, delicious <strong>Creamy</strong>. Find the right garbage and mix and match!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A wide range of menu options</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/2075bb6d014b5cdcf6f92862f525cd02.poster.avif?t=1786634228\" aria-label=\"A carboard bucket is filled with green goop, which is then microwaved and drawn on with chocolate syrup. The drawing is of a &quot;cool S&quot;.\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/2075bb6d014b5cdcf6f92862f525cd02.webm?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/2075bb6d014b5cdcf6f92862f525cd02.mp4?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't just prepare a batch of slop in advance and call it a day: each customer will want a specific <strong>flavor</strong> and may request an additional something, <strong>toppings</strong>, or one of many other options your menu can offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With time you'll even unlock <strong>drinks</strong> you can make out of fruits you'll grow yourself! Delicious lemonade with a perfectly legal amount of toxic fertilizer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Management knows how important it is to make the restaurant feel like it's really yours so you can change the name of each of the flavors! You think &quot;<strong>Ooey gooey yellowey tastey</strong>&quot; is better than &quot;<strong>Creamy</strong>&quot;? You got it, chef!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the neighborhood</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/62d0ba223a26aeb5e1d0432acbd161af.poster.avif?t=1786634228\" aria-label=\"A player stacks objects and human bodies to make platforms and climb on them\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/62d0ba223a26aeb5e1d0432acbd161af.webm?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/62d0ba223a26aeb5e1d0432acbd161af.mp4?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to success is knowing your environment: you're encouraged to explore your surroundings, break into homes, and get to know the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a place that's too hard to reach? You can <strong>stack items</strong> as high as you'd like to build ladders, towers and bridges, so you can climb them while yelling &quot;PARKOUR!!&quot;.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There's something for everyone!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/175917c3f49c186946b77befdd4f2b82.poster.avif?t=1786634228\" aria-label=\"The player jumps on trampolines, watches television with friends, and plays a game where you&#039;re a bear throwing a seal for points.\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/175917c3f49c186946b77befdd4f2b82.webm?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/175917c3f49c186946b77befdd4f2b82.mp4?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Oh bother</i>, did your friends drag you into this? Don't worry! There's plenty to do even if you don't care about the restaurant's financial success! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You could build jump puzzles with <strong>trampolines</strong>, play <strong>video games</strong> on the company laptop, and there's a rumor out there that the <strong>sewers</strong> hold countless riches and wonders for those brave enough to face them...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why you should you play this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/4466dc8f748f258d893f319c88623ade.poster.avif?t=1786634228\" aria-label=\"The player chases a raccoon, dances with a coworker while holding trash bags, and puts a human body in the slop machine then turns it on.\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/4466dc8f748f258d893f319c88623ade.webm?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/extras/4466dc8f748f258d893f319c88623ade.mp4?t=1786634228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slop Simulator is a goofy, <strong>chaotic</strong>, and kinda gross fast food simulator. It's a perfect game for you and your friends to mess around for the evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no player cap, it's full of shitty Unity Asset Store models and out-of-bounds <strong>secrets</strong>, you can play however you'd like with very few restrictions and there's so many main and side activities that everybody can find something they'll enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was made by a human with no generative AI involved, because that stuff really stinks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slop Simulator is a short joke project that turned into a one-year-long actual game, you're going to have a fantastic time. - MonAmiral</i></p>", "short_description": "Make slop out of trash, junk and pretty much anything and serve it to customers! A chaotic multiplayer first-person fast food simulator with barely any safeguards where you use only &quot;local and fresh&quot; ingredients. Made without generative AI!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/16bb96610acf81cb2f664645d9bbeeaed4a89491/header.jpg?t=1786634228", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/29885600dc26f6ec500c3fd9ab23ec7b4db683a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786634228", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199050/29885600dc26f6ec500c3fd9ab23ec7b4db683a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786634228", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 4690 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050 / RX 570 (4GB+ of VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Can run in &quot;dogshit&quot; quality for potato PCs</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Mon Amiral"], "publishers": ["Mon Amiral"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description